From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FirebirdTA01 <FirebirdTA01@aol.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:00:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 13/39] spu: call a zero-operand insn generator with no
 arguments

---
 gcc/config/spu/spu.cc | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/gcc/config/spu/spu.cc b/gcc/config/spu/spu.cc
index fb7613b0864..84626332267 100644
--- a/gcc/config/spu/spu.cc
+++ b/gcc/config/spu/spu.cc
@@ -6537,7 +6537,7 @@ spu_expand_builtin_1 (struct spu_builtin_description *d,
   switch (n_operands)
     {
     case 0:
-      pat = GEN_FCN (icode) (0);
+      pat = GEN_FCN (icode) ();
       break;
     case 1:
       pat = GEN_FCN (icode) (ops[0]);
